-//! Experimental read-only XMZ funding observer for caller-owned loopback services.
-//! This does not create wallets, sign, broadcast, or authorize live execution.
+//! Experimental XMZ funding/wallet-lifecycle RPC bridge for caller-owned loopback
+//! services. Observation, fee preview and wallet lifecycle here never sign or
+//! broadcast. `relay` is the sole exception: it is the only submodule capable of
+//! constructing, signing and broadcasting a real transaction, and it has no
+//! decode-from-untrusted-bytes entry point -- only swap orchestration code calls
+//! it directly. Nothing here authorizes live/mainnet execution on its own.
 //! Credentials are required and intentionally have no Debug or serialization API.
 pub mod fee_estimation;
+pub mod relay;
 pub mod wallet_session;
